    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "第1页共4页",
        "bbox": [
            640,
            885,
            757,
            898
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "与曲线 $y=-\\ln(-x)$ 的切点为 $(x_{2},-\\ln(-x_{2}))$ 且 $x_{2}<0,$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            90,
            561,
            107
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "又 $y' = (\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$ , $y' = [-\\ln (-x)] = -\\frac{1}{x}$ ，则直线 $y = kx + b$ 与曲线 $y = \\ln x$ 的切线方程为 $y - \\ln x_{1} = \\frac{1}{x_{1}} (x - x_{1})$ ，即 $y = \\frac{1}{x_{1}} x + \\ln x_{1} - 1$ ，直线 $y = kx + b$ 与曲线 $y = -\\ln (-x)$ 的切线方程为 $y + \\ln (-x_{2}) = -\\frac{1}{x_{2}} (x - x_{2})$ ，即 $y = -\\frac{1}{x_{2}} x + 1 - \\ln (-x_{2})$ ，则 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \\frac{1}{x_1} = -\\frac{1}{x_2} \\\\ \\ln x_1 - 1 = 1 - \\ln (-x_2) \\end{array} \\right.$ ，解得 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x_1 = e \\\\ x_2 = -e \\end{array} \\right.$ ，故 $k = \\frac{1}{x_1} = \\frac{1}{e}, b = \\ln x_1 - 1 = 0,$",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            118,
            838,
            273
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "9. BC【详解】 $(\\ln7)'=0$ ，A 错误； $[(x^{2}+2)\\sin x]'=2x\\sin x+(x^{2}+2)\\cos x$ ，B 正确；",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            284,
            821,
            300
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\left(\\frac{x^2}{\\mathrm{e}^x}\\right)' = \\frac{2x\\cdot\\mathrm{e}^x - x^2\\mathrm{e}^x}{\\mathrm{e}^{2x}} = \\frac{2x - x^2}{\\mathrm{e}^x}$ ，故C正确； $[\\ln (3x + 2)]' = \\frac{3}{3x + 2}$ ，故D错误.",
        "bbox": [
