    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "且 $f(-2) + f(5) = 1$ 即 $f(5) = 1 - f(2)$ ， $f(6) = f(0) = 2$",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            702,
            591,
            718
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所以 $f(5)+f(4)=1-f(2)+1-f(1)=2-1=1,$",
        "bbox": [
