            774
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所以 $\\sum_{n=1}^{2025} f(n) = \\sum_{n=1}^{337 \\times 6+3} f(n) = 337 \\times 3 + f(1) + f(2) + f(3) = 1011$ ，故 D 正确.",
        "bbox": [
